---
title: Command path · one write from a page or an agent, with a retry
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant caller as Page or MCP tool
  participant gw as Gateway
  participant pg as manor_command
  participant mirror as Local mirror
  caller->>gw: operation · input · expected_revision
  gw->>pg: command_id · operation · input
  pg->>pg: authorize · validate · check revision
  alt revision current
    pg->>pg: rows + action events + receipt · one transaction
    pg-->>gw: receipt · committed record · revision
  else revision moved
    pg-->>gw: conflict with current state
  end
  opt no answer, or a serialization failure
    gw->>pg: same command_id
    pg-->>gw: stored receipt · replayed
  end
  gw->>mirror: pull after the command
  gw-->>caller: receipt · touched tables published
